  `packages/scaffold/tests/cli.test.ts`.

## Phase 6 — Docs updates

- [packages/scaffold/README.md](packages/scaffold/README.md): document `--yes`/`-y`, `--version`, and add
  a "Shell completions" section (`pantoken-scaffold completion zsh`, etc.). Also fix a pre-existing stale
  example found while reading this file — `npx @pantoken/scaffold react ./my-app` (a second positional)
  never actually worked; correct it to `npx @pantoken/scaffold react --dir ./my-app`.
- [packages/create-pantoken-app/README.md](packages/create-pantoken-app/README.md): document `--dir`,
  `--yes`, and the TTY-interactive default.
- [ai/pantoken-ai/README.md](ai/pantoken-ai/README.md): update `Usage` for `--dir`/`--yes` on `scaffold`,
  note the shared prompt/spinner UX, add a completions blurb.
