  [docs/hu/guide/getting-started.md](docs/hu/guide/getting-started.md)): the existing
  `npx create-pantoken-app react` example still works verbatim; add one sentence noting the CLI now
  prompts interactively for platform/directory when run without arguments in a terminal, and supports
  `--yes` for scripting. Add the equivalent plain sentence to the Hungarian mirror.
