  functions/types in both `cli.ts` files proper doc comments matching the existing `@module`/`@alpha` style.

## Phase 7 — Changeset

One changeset covering all three packages, following the precedent of
`.changeset/scaffold-cli-prompt-and-vp-install.md` (from the prior CLI-unification commit `ef503aa0`):

```md
---
"@pantoken/scaffold": minor
"create-pantoken-app": minor
"@pantoken/ai": minor
---

`pantoken-scaffold`, `create-pantoken-app`, and `pantoken-ai scaffold` now share one commander-based CLI
engine (exported from `@pantoken/scaffold/cli`) with proper `--help`, `--version`, and shell completions
