message now leads with your detected package manager's install command. `pantoken-ai scaffold` gains the
same platform/directory prompts as the other two CLIs, and its post-scaffold message now matches theirs.
```

Bump level `minor` for all three (new flags/behavior, no removal of a documented stable API —
`shouldPromptForDir`'s rename is an internal `@alpha`-tagged export).

